# Deník listing

`/denik` uses `Sections/denik.twig`. Rituály and umění have their own listing layouts.

## Layout

- White intro: eyebrow, title, lead
- Continuous **feed of whole diary posts** (same body as detail via `Posts/body.twig` + `Posts/parts.twig`)
- Flat white ground (no greige bands); slightly tighter padding than standalone `/denik/{slug}`
- Title links to the standalone post URL (`linkedTitle`); no section eyebrow in the feed
- All published deník posts in one response (no AJAX pager yet)
- No scroll / entrance animations on the index
